<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken, Stadshypotek shrs jump.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken, Stadshypotek shrs jump.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken jumped 14 crowns to 200 and mortgage bank Stadshypotek rose 7.5 to 188.5 crowns on the Stockholm bourse after trading resumed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trading in the two companies was suspended earlier in the afternoon pending an announcement from Handelsbanken about a 23 billion crown takeover bid for Stadshypotek.  </p>
<p>Before the news Handelsbanken shares were trading at 186 crowns, down 2.5 crowns on Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>Stadshypotek was trading at 181 crowns, one crown lower than its Wednesday closing price.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
